rules/origins/index.content:
Origins
An origin is the mechanical impact of who a character was before the campaign began. Whatever environment shaped their instincts, whatever work hardened their hands, and whatever information or favors they may hold up their sleeve is exemplified and enforced by your origin.
LIST
FROM &quot;Rules/Origins&quot;
WHERE Type = &quot;Origin&quot;
SORT file.name ASC

