rules/spells/index.content:
Spells
Every spell, sorted by League. See Magic for how casting works.
1st League
TABLE WITHOUT ID file.link AS Spell, Genesis, Anima, Time
FROM &quot;Rules/Spells&quot;
WHERE Type = &quot;Spell&quot; AND League = &quot;1st&quot;
SORT file.name ASC
